      "reason": "The actual chain combines return-path inversion with rival backcasting. It holds I1-I4 fixed, mutes the emitter after the first initial ticket, declines optional Q service, and keeps unchanged parent functions and preferred Relay transport. Its builder then activates the specific supplied retained-preset write route through a permissive rejoin and eligible ping. Persistent Escape and Recurrence yield opposing new-Q predictions. This is a supported proposed discriminator, not an assertion that either later world occurred.",
